  "jei.simplemachines.info.diamond_cable": "HV cable, light blue. Carries up to 64,000 FE per tick. Joins only other HV cables.",
  "jei.simplemachines.info.lv_mv_transformer": "The front (yellow ring) is MV and faces you when placed. The other faces (red rings) are LV. Click a face with a screwdriver to make it the MV side, or sneak-click to swap it to the opposite face. Power goes both ways, up to 1,000 FE per tick each way, losing 5%.",
  "jei.simplemachines.info.mv_hv_transformer": "The front (light blue ring) is HV and faces you when placed. The other faces (yellow rings) are MV. Click a face with a screwdriver to make it the HV side, or sneak-click to swap it to the opposite face. Power goes both ways, up to 8,000 FE per tick each way, losing 5%.",
  "jei.simplemachines.info.overvoltage": "Every machine and battery is LV, the Diamond Solar Panel MV. Feeding a higher voltage into a lower rated block makes it explode.",
