  "message.simplemachines.quarry_filter_full": "All %s filter slots are full. Sneak with an empty hand to take one out",
  "jei.simplemachines.info.quarry": "Runs on MV only, 8000 FE per block mined (400 FE/t at 1 block per second, about 1500 FE/t at 3.75). LV will not feed it and HV blows it up. Stores 200k FE, 400k on steel. Digs out the area beside it down to bedrock, skipping air and fluids. Place Landmarks up to 64 blocks away in front of it and to one side to set the size, otherwise 16x16. Speed: iron 1 block per second, steel chassis x1.5, steel drill body x1.25, plus drill and chassis upgrades (together up to x2). A diamond bit digs obsidian and ancient debris. Fit up to 3 Pipe Filters to choose what it keeps; the rest is voided. Deny filters always void what they list, and with any allow filter fitted, only what one of them allows is kept.",
  "jei.simplemachines.info.quarry_assembly": "Crafted with an Electric Drill, which keeps its body, bit and upgrades inside the quarry.",
  "jei.simplemachines.info.landmark": "Marks a far corner of a quarry: one in line with its front, one to its side, up to 64 blocks away.",
